  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The energy that forms a stormbound’s Storm veil is inherently chaotic and destructive, and only with great effort can the stormbound maintain control over it. This same chaos allows her to easily alter the nature and form of her shaped Storm veils. At 2nd level, when the stormbound rolls initiative, and at the beginning of each of her turns, she can unshape a single Shaped storm veil, and immediately shape a new one in its place. Doing so burns half the essence invested in the Veil (rounded up, minimum 1), and is done before she gains temporary essence for the turn from her stormweaving ability. If the Storm veil she unshapes was bound to her chakra, the new Storm veil she shapes in its place is also bound.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/stormbound#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
